<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef mostly steady on light to moderate demand and offerings.  Select and Choice rib, chuck and round cuts steady  to weak, while the loin cuts steady to firm.  Beef trimmings generally steady on light demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>226 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 22 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>7 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     103.40	103.79	 98.47	 97.94</p>
<p>Changes	   0.08	  0.06	  0.20	  0.41</p>
<p>Rib	  163.23	163.40	156.58	156.90</p>
<p>Chuck	 67.76	 67.12	 68.99	 66.96</p>
<p>Round	 87.35	 87.35	 85.06	 85.06</p>
